<v Sam Gebler>And we pull her onto the board. We have this technique where we flip them onto the board and so she's out of the water. She's on the surfboard, the rescue board. And she's not breathing. We do some-- trying to do CPR in the water when you're just--
<v Sam Gebler>我们把她拉上板子。我们有一种技术，就是把她们翻到板子上，这样她就出了水面。她在冲浪板上，救援板上。她没呼吸。我们做了些——尝试在水里做心肺复苏，当你只是——

