<v Sam Gebler>Yeah, I mean, there's a ton of sharks out there, especially in the deep water, where we're getting sucked out to. And so, I'm just amazed at myself thinking about COVID in a situation like this, you know?
<v Sam Gebler>是的，我的意思是，那儿有很多鲨鱼，尤其是在深水区，我们正被吸进去的地方。所以我很惊讶自己在这种情况下还在想新冠，你知道吗？

00:48:15.200 --> 00:48:33.690
<v Sam Gebler>And I'll never forget looking over to my coworker. And we just kind of looked at each other as she's coughing in our face. And I can see it all over his face, too. And we just had that nonverbal communication, where we're both like, oh, damn.
