00:48:33.690 --> 00:48:44.430
<v Dana Chivvis>I can't imagine anything that's more pandemic 2020 than being swept out to sea in shark-infested water and still not being able to escape the anxiety of COVID.
<v Dana Chivvis>我无法想象有什么比被卷入鲨鱼出没的海水，却依然无法逃脱新冠焦虑更具2020疫情特色的了。

