<v Ken Gethard>And on one hand, we're like the guilt. We got to protect you. Why couldn't we see this? But on the other hand, it's like, why didn't he come to us? Even now, you're like that, Chris. There was something on the web a couple of years ago was something. This is what I look like on a bad day, when I'm feeling depressed.
<v Ken Gethard>一方面，我们觉得有内疚感。我们得保护你。为什么我们看不出来？但另一方面，就像是，为什么他不来找我们？即使现在，你也是那样，克里斯。几年前网上有东西……这是我感觉抑郁时，糟糕的一天的样子。

