00:53:28.380 --> 00:54:04.300
<v Chris Gethard>I don't know why I've never been comfortable with you guys seeing me like that or knowing that side of me so well. But I just felt like it was a thing to hide. I don't know. I don't know why. I don't know why. Because you guys did-- as soon as I told you, it was like everyone went into this mode where I was so supported. And I had always assumed that if I ever told anybody about it, I was going to be on my own. Whereas when I kind of hit rock bottom and started talking to you guys about it, it was like instantaneously the safest I ever felt.
<v Chris Gethard>我不知道为什么我从没适应你们看到我这样，或者了解我的那一面。但我只是觉得那是该隐藏的事。我不知道。我不知道为什么。因为你们——当我告诉你们时，每个人都进入了那种模式，我得到了巨大的支持。我一直假设如果我告诉任何人，我就得独自一人。而当我触底并开始和你们谈论它时，那是我感觉最安全的一瞬间。

